{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（18日）下午5時許，警方接獲報案，北角城市花園道28號電燈中心地下電掣房突然爆炸，一名20多歲男員工身體多處燒傷，包括臉及雙手等，幸仍清醒。男事主送往瑪麗醫院。勞工處及機電工程署派員到場調查。案件暫時列作火警。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:00.845907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:46:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:20.090894+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:20.090894+00:00","content_hash":"b79b0e7ec66b50bc48d7866a16670c0be37c68f76614d8cbc33e7c66ed6a611a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}